[sliver] Each 1.2 mm vertical land is the full-projection end of a 3 mm retaining lip. A 45-degree lead-in builds from the bed up to this land, and the lip joins the complete 2 mm skirt over its 24 mm run. The measurement is the land height, not the skirt thickness.
